{"adaptation_version": "aics-native-v1", "modifications": "Adapted to existing platform contracts and native AE/Resolve; removed upstream identity, automatic installation, cloud uploads and fixed universal presets.", "stage": "voice", "tags": ["persona-production", "voice", "candidate"], "text": "读取已批准口播与角色音色，先检查专名、数字和自然停顿，再使用现有配音渠道。保存原音频及修订稿，区分引擎返回时标、对真实音频做出的对齐和估计时标；估计值不可冒充已验证词级定位。用真实音频决定镜头长度，核对开头、结尾、专名与删改位置。词序或音频变化后重新生成对应字幕与动画锚点。", "upstream": [{"commit": "762d3ee42623b75a4ec63ad6aa61ace69d78ce6e", "files": [{"name": "references/styled-explainer.md", "sha256": "52276dcb9e3d057f84253f77e044c97b2e6f66730bdb703f07311ecfd38ea288"}], "license": "MIT", "repository": "cclank/lanshu-create-ai-presenter-video"}]}

