{"adaptation_version": "aics-native-v1", "modifications": "Adapted to existing platform contracts and native AE/Resolve; removed upstream identity, automatic installation, cloud uploads and fixed universal presets.", "stage": "storyboard", "tags": ["persona-production", "storyboard", "candidate"], "text": "逐句确定视觉用途：展示事实用真实界面或原素材，解释关系用图层，强调判断用关键词或数字卡。记录镜头对应句子、素材版本、图层关系、入场停留退出及声音意图；让观众有时间读完，不把统一秒数当规则。静帧先确认再写图生视频运动提示词。需要包装时给AE明确参数，剪辑主时间线留在Resolve。", "upstream": [{"commit": "13c74a707786872a18e3317e48c5c94011027620", "files": [{"name": "SKILL.md", "sha256": "a94f87f093d07c96ddf3245d442acece7ceb6c544035855c63e26a216a068820"}, {"name": "references/sound-design.md", "sha256": "cac6f23c0b360cef7c7d04655f3009cf5e45f79e5f775594a622e680b0301521"}], "license": "Apache-2.0", "repository": "Vincentwei1021/video-shotcraft"}, {"commit": "762d3ee42623b75a4ec63ad6aa61ace69d78ce6e", "files": [{"name": "references/styled-explainer.md", "sha256": "52276dcb9e3d057f84253f77e044c97b2e6f66730bdb703f07311ecfd38ea288"}], "license": "MIT", "repository": "cclank/lanshu-create-ai-presenter-video"}]}

